#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-registry-pin.md:44
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-registry-pin.md:46
msgid ""
"This command adds an entry to the user registry that maps flake reference "
"_url_ to the corresponding _locked_ flake reference, that is, a flake "
"reference that specifies an exact revision or content hash. This ensures "
"that until this registry entry is removed, all uses of _url_ will resolve to "
"exactly the same flake."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-registry-pin.md:52
msgid ""
"Entries can be removed using [`nix registry remove`](./nix3-registry-remove."
"md)."
msgstr ""

